# An edge of the solid that no entity draws, picked on the model and
# named "notch" on the datums screen; the same as path_datum_solid_edge.go
# makes (TestPathEquivalence/datum_solid_edge).
file $testdata/topo/slot.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
click-edge the edge between side face of g003-block from r005-line-segment and side face of g005-slot from r00a-line-segment
menu Edit|Datums...
tw
twmove 100 130
twdown L 100 130
twup L 100 130
edit notch
